#MOBILE
Vnum       40801
Keywords   ketu master temple~
Short      Ketu~
Long       Ketu stands motionless at the chamber's center, eyes fixed on nothing in particular.
~
Desc       Ketu, Master of Akar Kesh and foremost among the Je'daii Council,
carries an unshakable calm that seems to radiate outward from the
Temple itself. Neither Ashla nor Bogan holds sway here - only the
balance between them, which Ketu has spent a lifetime learning to
hold steady.
~
Race       Human~
Position   standing~
DefPos     standing~
Gender     male~
Actflags   npc sentinel~
